message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "bioleads"
abstract: >-
  Mine biomedical literature for enriched terms, co-occurrence networks, and
  Swanson-style hypothesis leads from PubMed/PMC and reference-manager
  exports, with optional biomedical NER and PubMedBERT term clustering.
type: software
